OL,3,GNEWSAPole position? These women are set
OL,4,Ato scale a 25ft greasy pole - to win a
OL,5,Aprize ham
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Bex Campbell bumps into people she
OL,8,Fknows in the street these days, they
OL,9,Fall say the same thing.
OL,11,F"People keep stopping me in the street
OL,12,Fand going 'are you mad, are you
OL,13,Factually doing the greasy pole this
OL,14,Fyear?'," the 37-year-old says with a
OL,15,Flaugh.
OL,17,FBex is one of a five-strong all female
OL,18,Fteam tackling one of Irvine's more
OL,19,Funique challenges - scaling a 25ft
OL,20,F(7.6m) wooden pole covered in grease,
OL,21,Fand trying to claim the prize at the
OL,22,Ftop - a ham.
OL,23,APub: 15-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
